+			<td style="width: 10px;"><a href="/images/ilm/climate/Florence/ILMdata.png"><img alt="Hurricane Florence one-minute pressure and wind gust data from Wilmington, NC.  Peak wind gust was 105 mph and lowest pressure was 28.52 inches Hg (965.5 millibars)" src="/images/ilm/climate/Florence/ILMdata.png" style="width: 403px; height: 268px;" /></a> <span style="font-size:10px;">Hurricane Florence one-minute pressure and wind gust data from Wilmington, NC.&nbsp; Peak wind gust at the ILM airport was 105 mph and lowest pressure was 28.51 inches of mercury or 965.5 millibars. (credit: NWS/Tim Armstrong)</span></td>
+		</tr>
