+
+			<p><span style="font-size:10px;">Graphic showing the all-time record crest of 17.87 feet on the Waccamaw River at Conway, SC on October 18, 2016.&nbsp; This crest broke records previously set during the October 2015 floods, Hurricane Floyd in September 1999, and the 1945 Homestead Hurricane.</span></p>
